          "thread": "Institutional reserve onboarding votes",
          "why": "The live DAO votes on BlackRock BUIDL and Superstate USTB as backing assets gave readers a front-row seat to watch a DeFi protocol formally hand reserve custody to TradFi names, a historically rare governance moment."
